{"title":"P13888 - P13888 [蓝桥杯 2023 省 Python A] 翻转 - 洛谷","slug":"2026-05-22-P13888-P13888-蓝桥杯-2023-省-Python-A-翻转-洛谷","date":"2026-05-21T16:00:00.000Z","updated":"2026-05-22T13:27:49.084Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/2026-05-22-P13888-P13888-蓝桥杯-2023-省-Python-A-翻转-洛谷.json","excerpt":null,"covers":null,"content":"<h2 id=\"洛谷-P13888-翻转-洛谷\"><a href=\"#洛谷-P13888-翻转-洛谷\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"[洛谷 P13888] 翻转 - 洛谷\"></a>[洛谷 P13888] 翻转 - 洛谷</h2><h3 id=\"题目概览\"><a href=\"#题目概览\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"题目概览\"></a>题目概览</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>题目来源</strong>: 洛谷</li>\n<li><strong>题目难度</strong>: ★★★★☆</li>\n<li><strong>标签分类</strong>: 算法, 字符串处理</li>\n<li><strong>核心考点</strong>: 字符串翻转, 贪心算法</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"题意解析\"><a href=\"#题意解析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"题意解析\"></a>题意解析</h3><p>给定两个字符串 <code>S</code> 和 <code>T</code>，我们需要通过翻转 <code>S</code> 中的某些字符使得 <code>S</code> 变成 <code>T</code>。翻转的条件是字符与其左右两边都不相同，即出现 <code>101</code> 或 <code>010</code>。如果无法通过翻转得到 <code>T</code>，则输出 <code>-1</code>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"算法思路（核心部分）\"><a href=\"#算法思路（核心部分）\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"算法思路（核心部分）\"></a>算法思路（核心部分）</h3><h4 id=\"4-1-问题分析\"><a href=\"#4-1-问题分析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4.1 问题分析\"></a>4.1 问题分析</h4><ul>\n<li><strong>本质</strong>: 需要在字符串 <code>S</code> 中找到可以翻转的字符，使得 <code>S</code> 变成 <code>T</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>关键观察点</strong>:<ul>\n<li>首尾字符无法被翻转。</li>\n<li>中间字符的翻转需要满足特定条件。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"4-2-算法原理\"><a href=\"#4-2-算法原理\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4.2 算法原理\"></a>4.2 算法原理</h4><ul>\n<li><strong>朴素思路</strong>:<ul>\n<li>从左到右遍历字符串，检查每个字符是否需要翻转。</li>\n<li>如果当前字符与 <code>T</code> 中对应位置的字符不同，检查其左右字符是否与 <code>T</code> 中对应位置的字符相同。</li>\n<li>如果满足条件，翻转当前字符，并计数。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>优化路径</strong>:<ul>\n<li>通过贪心算法，每次发现不匹配时立即检查并翻转。</li>\n<li>避免不必要的检查，提高效率。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>核心思想</strong>:<ul>\n<li>翻转中间字符的前提是左右字符已经匹配。</li>\n<li>从左到右扫描，每次发现不匹配时立即检查并翻转。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"4-3-数学推导（如适用）\"><a href=\"#4-3-数学推导（如适用）\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4.3 数学推导（如适用）\"></a>4.3 数学推导（如适用）</h4><ul>\n<li>无需复杂的数学推导，主要依赖于贪心算法的逻辑。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"4-4-多种解法对比（如适用）\"><a href=\"#4-4-多种解法对比（如适用）\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4.4 多种解法对比（如适用）\"></a>4.4 多种解法对比（如适用）</h4><div class=\"table-container\">\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>解法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>代码难度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>贪心算法</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>小规模数据</td>\n<td>简单</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"代码详解\"><a href=\"#代码详解\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"代码详解\"></a>代码详解</h3><h4 id=\"5-1-核心代码段\"><a href=\"#5-1-核心代码段\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"5.1 核心代码段\"></a>5.1 核心代码段</h4><figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br><span class=\"line\">32</span><br><span class=\"line\">33</span><br><span class=\"line\">34</span><br><span class=\"line\">35</span><br><span class=\"line\">36</span><br><span class=\"line\">37</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">solve</span>():</span><br><span class=\"line\">    data = sys.stdin.read().split()</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"keyword\">not</span> data:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">return</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    d = <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(data[<span class=\"number\">0</span>])</span><br><span class=\"line\">    idx = <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    out_lines = []</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> _ <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(d):</span><br><span class=\"line\">        T = data[idx]</span><br><span class=\"line\">        idx += <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        S = data[idx]</span><br><span class=\"line\">        idx += <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        n = <span class=\"built_in\">len</span>(S)</span><br><span class=\"line\">        </span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> S[<span class=\"number\">0</span>] != T[<span class=\"number\">0</span>] <span class=\"keyword\">or</span> S[-<span class=\"number\">1</span>] != T[-<span class=\"number\">1</span>]:</span><br><span class=\"line\">            out_lines.append(<span class=\"string\">&quot;-1&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"keyword\">continue</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        </span><br><span class=\"line\">        ans = <span class=\"number\">0</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        s = <span class=\"built_in\">list</span>(S)</span><br><span class=\"line\">        possible = <span class=\"literal\">True</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        </span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(<span class=\"number\">1</span>, n - <span class=\"number\">1</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> s[i] != T[i]:</span><br><span class=\"line\">                <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> s[i - <span class=\"number\">1</span>] == T[i] <span class=\"keyword\">and</span> s[i + <span class=\"number\">1</span>] == T[i]:</span><br><span class=\"line\">                    s[i] = T[i]</span><br><span class=\"line\">                    ans += <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">                <span class=\"keyword\">else</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">                    possible = <span class=\"literal\">False</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">                    <span class=\"keyword\">break</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        </span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> possible:</span><br><span class=\"line\">            out_lines.append(<span class=\"built_in\">str</span>(ans))</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">else</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">            out_lines.append(<span class=\"string\">&quot;-1&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    </span><br><span class=\"line\">    sys.stdout.write(<span class=\"string\">&quot;\\n&quot;</span>.join(out_lines))</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h4 id=\"5-2-逐行解析\"><a href=\"#5-2-逐行解析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"5.2 逐行解析\"></a>5.2 逐行解析</h4><ul>\n<li><code>data = sys.stdin.read().split()</code>: 读取所有输入数据并分割成列表。</li>\n<li><code>if not data: return</code>: 检查输入是否为空，为空则直接返回。</li>\n<li><code>d = int(data[0])</code>: 读取第一个数字 <code>d</code>，表示接下来有 <code>d</code> 组测试数据。</li>\n<li><code>idx = 1</code>: 初始化索引 <code>idx</code>。</li>\n<li><code>for _ in range(d):</code>: 循环 <code>d</code> 次处理每组测试数据。</li>\n<li><code>T = data[idx]</code>: 读取字符串 <code>T</code>。</li>\n<li><code>idx += 1</code>: 更新索引 <code>idx</code>。</li>\n<li><code>S = data[idx]</code>: 读取字符串 <code>S</code>。</li>\n<li><code>idx += 1</code>: 更新索引 <code>idx</code>。</li>\n<li><code>n = len(S)</code>: 获取字符串长度。</li>\n<li><code>if S[0] != T[0] or S[-1] != T[-1]:</code>: 检查首尾字符是否匹配，如果不匹配则输出 <code>-1</code>。</li>\n<li><code>ans = 0</code>: 初始化翻转次数 <code>ans</code>。</li>\n<li><code>s = list(S)</code>: 将字符串 <code>S</code> 转换为列表以便修改。</li>\n<li><code>possible = True</code>: 初始化可能翻转标志 <code>possible</code>。</li>\n<li><code>for i in range(1, n - 1):</code>: 循环遍历字符串 <code>S</code> 中间部分。</li>\n<li><code>if s[i] != T[i]:</code>: 如果当前字符与 <code>T</code> 中对应位置的字符不同。</li>\n<li><code>if s[i - 1] == T[i] and s[i + 1] == T[i]:</code>: 如果左右字符与 <code>T</code> 中对应位置的字符相同。</li>\n<li><code>s[i] = T[i]</code>: 翻转当前字符。</li>\n<li><code>ans += 1</code>: 翻转次数加一。</li>\n<li><code>else:</code>: 如果不满足翻转条件，设置 <code>possible</code> 为 <code>False</code> 并跳出循环。</li>\n<li><code>if possible:</code>: 如果可能翻转，输出翻转次数。</li>\n<li><code>else:</code>: 如果不可能翻转，输出 <code>-1</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"5-3-优化技巧\"><a href=\"#5-3-优化技巧\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"5.3 优化技巧\"></a>5.3 优化技巧</h4><ul>\n<li><strong>空间优化</strong>: 本代码已经是最简形式，无需额外空间优化。</li>\n<li><strong>时间优化</strong>: 通过贪心算法，每次发现不匹配时立即检查并翻转，避免了不必要的检查。</li>\n<li><strong>代码优化</strong>: 代码简洁明了，易于理解和维护。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"6-复杂度分析\"><a href=\"#6-复杂度分析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"6. 复杂度分析\"></a>6. 复杂度分析</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>时间复杂度</strong>: O(n)，其中 n 是字符串 <code>S</code> 的长度。</li>\n<li><strong>空间复杂度</strong>: O(1)，仅使用了常数级别的额外空间。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"7-输入输出示例\"><a href=\"#7-输入输出示例\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"7. 输入输出示例\"></a>7. 输入输出示例</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>样例输入</strong>:<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">1101</span><br><span class=\"line\">1010</span><br><span class=\"line\">1110</span><br><span class=\"line\">1001</span><br><span class=\"line\">1100</span><br><span class=\"line\">1011</span><br><span class=\"line\">1111</span><br><span class=\"line\">1000</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>\n<li><strong>样例输出</strong>:<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"8-常见错误与调试技巧\"><a href=\"#8-常见错误与调试技巧\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"8. 常见错误与调试技巧\"></a>8. 常见错误与调试技巧</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>易错点</strong>:<ul>\n<li>忽略首尾字符无法翻转的情况。</li>\n<li>错误地认为左右字符必须与 <code>T</code> 中对应位置的字符相同。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>调试方法</strong>:<ul>\n<li>通过打印中间变量 <code>s</code>, <code>ans</code>, <code>possible</code> 来跟踪程序执行过程。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>测试用例</strong>:<ul>\n<li>使用不同长度和内容的字符串进行测试，确保算法的正确性。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"9-总结与扩展\"><a href=\"#9-总结与扩展\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"9. 总结与扩展\"></a>9. 总结与扩展</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>核心收获</strong>:<ul>\n<li>学会使用贪心算法解决字符串翻转问题。</li>\n<li>理解翻转操作的条件和限制。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>举一反三</strong>:<ul>\n<li>类似题目如 “翻转二进制字符串”、”翻转字符串 II” 等。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>进阶方向</strong>:<ul>\n<li>进一步优化算法，考虑更复杂的情况，如多个可能的翻转序列等。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","more":"<h2 id=\"洛谷-P13888-翻转-洛谷\"><a href=\"#洛谷-P13888-翻转-洛谷\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"[洛谷 P13888] 翻转 - 洛谷\"></a>[洛谷 P13888] 翻转 - 洛谷</h2><h3 id=\"题目概览\"><a href=\"#题目概览\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"题目概览\"></a>题目概览</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>题目来源</strong>: 洛谷</li>\n<li><strong>题目难度</strong>: ★★★★☆</li>\n<li><strong>标签分类</strong>: 算法, 字符串处理</li>\n<li><strong>核心考点</strong>: 字符串翻转, 贪心算法</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"题意解析\"><a href=\"#题意解析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"题意解析\"></a>题意解析</h3><p>给定两个字符串 <code>S</code> 和 <code>T</code>，我们需要通过翻转 <code>S</code> 中的某些字符使得 <code>S</code> 变成 <code>T</code>。翻转的条件是字符与其左右两边都不相同，即出现 <code>101</code> 或 <code>010</code>。如果无法通过翻转得到 <code>T</code>，则输出 <code>-1</code>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"算法思路（核心部分）\"><a href=\"#算法思路（核心部分）\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"算法思路（核心部分）\"></a>算法思路（核心部分）</h3><h4 id=\"4-1-问题分析\"><a href=\"#4-1-问题分析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4.1 问题分析\"></a>4.1 问题分析</h4><ul>\n<li><strong>本质</strong>: 需要在字符串 <code>S</code> 中找到可以翻转的字符，使得 <code>S</code> 变成 <code>T</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>关键观察点</strong>:<ul>\n<li>首尾字符无法被翻转。</li>\n<li>中间字符的翻转需要满足特定条件。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"4-2-算法原理\"><a href=\"#4-2-算法原理\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4.2 算法原理\"></a>4.2 算法原理</h4><ul>\n<li><strong>朴素思路</strong>:<ul>\n<li>从左到右遍历字符串，检查每个字符是否需要翻转。</li>\n<li>如果当前字符与 <code>T</code> 中对应位置的字符不同，检查其左右字符是否与 <code>T</code> 中对应位置的字符相同。</li>\n<li>如果满足条件，翻转当前字符，并计数。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>优化路径</strong>:<ul>\n<li>通过贪心算法，每次发现不匹配时立即检查并翻转。</li>\n<li>避免不必要的检查，提高效率。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>核心思想</strong>:<ul>\n<li>翻转中间字符的前提是左右字符已经匹配。</li>\n<li>从左到右扫描，每次发现不匹配时立即检查并翻转。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"4-3-数学推导（如适用）\"><a href=\"#4-3-数学推导（如适用）\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4.3 数学推导（如适用）\"></a>4.3 数学推导（如适用）</h4><ul>\n<li>无需复杂的数学推导，主要依赖于贪心算法的逻辑。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"4-4-多种解法对比（如适用）\"><a href=\"#4-4-多种解法对比（如适用）\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4.4 多种解法对比（如适用）\"></a>4.4 多种解法对比（如适用）</h4><div class=\"table-container\">\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>解法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>代码难度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>贪心算法</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>小规模数据</td>\n<td>简单</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"代码详解\"><a href=\"#代码详解\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"代码详解\"></a>代码详解</h3><h4 id=\"5-1-核心代码段\"><a href=\"#5-1-核心代码段\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"5.1 核心代码段\"></a>5.1 核心代码段</h4><figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br><span class=\"line\">32</span><br><span class=\"line\">33</span><br><span class=\"line\">34</span><br><span class=\"line\">35</span><br><span class=\"line\">36</span><br><span class=\"line\">37</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">solve</span>():</span><br><span class=\"line\">    data = sys.stdin.read().split()</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"keyword\">not</span> data:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">return</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    d = <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(data[<span class=\"number\">0</span>])</span><br><span class=\"line\">    idx = <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    out_lines = []</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> _ <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(d):</span><br><span class=\"line\">        T = data[idx]</span><br><span class=\"line\">        idx += <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        S = data[idx]</span><br><span class=\"line\">        idx += <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        n = <span class=\"built_in\">len</span>(S)</span><br><span class=\"line\">        </span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> S[<span class=\"number\">0</span>] != T[<span class=\"number\">0</span>] <span class=\"keyword\">or</span> S[-<span class=\"number\">1</span>] != T[-<span class=\"number\">1</span>]:</span><br><span class=\"line\">            out_lines.append(<span class=\"string\">&quot;-1&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"keyword\">continue</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        </span><br><span class=\"line\">        ans = <span class=\"number\">0</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        s = <span class=\"built_in\">list</span>(S)</span><br><span class=\"line\">        possible = <span class=\"literal\">True</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        </span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(<span class=\"number\">1</span>, n - <span class=\"number\">1</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> s[i] != T[i]:</span><br><span class=\"line\">                <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> s[i - <span class=\"number\">1</span>] == T[i] <span class=\"keyword\">and</span> s[i + <span class=\"number\">1</span>] == T[i]:</span><br><span class=\"line\">                    s[i] = T[i]</span><br><span class=\"line\">                    ans += <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">                <span class=\"keyword\">else</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">                    possible = <span class=\"literal\">False</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">                    <span class=\"keyword\">break</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        </span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> possible:</span><br><span class=\"line\">            out_lines.append(<span class=\"built_in\">str</span>(ans))</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">else</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">            out_lines.append(<span class=\"string\">&quot;-1&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    </span><br><span class=\"line\">    sys.stdout.write(<span class=\"string\">&quot;\\n&quot;</span>.join(out_lines))</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h4 id=\"5-2-逐行解析\"><a href=\"#5-2-逐行解析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"5.2 逐行解析\"></a>5.2 逐行解析</h4><ul>\n<li><code>data = sys.stdin.read().split()</code>: 读取所有输入数据并分割成列表。</li>\n<li><code>if not data: return</code>: 检查输入是否为空，为空则直接返回。</li>\n<li><code>d = int(data[0])</code>: 读取第一个数字 <code>d</code>，表示接下来有 <code>d</code> 组测试数据。</li>\n<li><code>idx = 1</code>: 初始化索引 <code>idx</code>。</li>\n<li><code>for _ in range(d):</code>: 循环 <code>d</code> 次处理每组测试数据。</li>\n<li><code>T = data[idx]</code>: 读取字符串 <code>T</code>。</li>\n<li><code>idx += 1</code>: 更新索引 <code>idx</code>。</li>\n<li><code>S = data[idx]</code>: 读取字符串 <code>S</code>。</li>\n<li><code>idx += 1</code>: 更新索引 <code>idx</code>。</li>\n<li><code>n = len(S)</code>: 获取字符串长度。</li>\n<li><code>if S[0] != T[0] or S[-1] != T[-1]:</code>: 检查首尾字符是否匹配，如果不匹配则输出 <code>-1</code>。</li>\n<li><code>ans = 0</code>: 初始化翻转次数 <code>ans</code>。</li>\n<li><code>s = list(S)</code>: 将字符串 <code>S</code> 转换为列表以便修改。</li>\n<li><code>possible = True</code>: 初始化可能翻转标志 <code>possible</code>。</li>\n<li><code>for i in range(1, n - 1):</code>: 循环遍历字符串 <code>S</code> 中间部分。</li>\n<li><code>if s[i] != T[i]:</code>: 如果当前字符与 <code>T</code> 中对应位置的字符不同。</li>\n<li><code>if s[i - 1] == T[i] and s[i + 1] == T[i]:</code>: 如果左右字符与 <code>T</code> 中对应位置的字符相同。</li>\n<li><code>s[i] = T[i]</code>: 翻转当前字符。</li>\n<li><code>ans += 1</code>: 翻转次数加一。</li>\n<li><code>else:</code>: 如果不满足翻转条件，设置 <code>possible</code> 为 <code>False</code> 并跳出循环。</li>\n<li><code>if possible:</code>: 如果可能翻转，输出翻转次数。</li>\n<li><code>else:</code>: 如果不可能翻转，输出 <code>-1</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"5-3-优化技巧\"><a href=\"#5-3-优化技巧\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"5.3 优化技巧\"></a>5.3 优化技巧</h4><ul>\n<li><strong>空间优化</strong>: 本代码已经是最简形式，无需额外空间优化。</li>\n<li><strong>时间优化</strong>: 通过贪心算法，每次发现不匹配时立即检查并翻转，避免了不必要的检查。</li>\n<li><strong>代码优化</strong>: 代码简洁明了，易于理解和维护。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"6-复杂度分析\"><a href=\"#6-复杂度分析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"6. 复杂度分析\"></a>6. 复杂度分析</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>时间复杂度</strong>: O(n)，其中 n 是字符串 <code>S</code> 的长度。</li>\n<li><strong>空间复杂度</strong>: O(1)，仅使用了常数级别的额外空间。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"7-输入输出示例\"><a href=\"#7-输入输出示例\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"7. 输入输出示例\"></a>7. 输入输出示例</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>样例输入</strong>:<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">1101</span><br><span class=\"line\">1010</span><br><span class=\"line\">1110</span><br><span class=\"line\">1001</span><br><span class=\"line\">1100</span><br><span class=\"line\">1011</span><br><span class=\"line\">1111</span><br><span class=\"line\">1000</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>\n<li><strong>样例输出</strong>:<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"8-常见错误与调试技巧\"><a href=\"#8-常见错误与调试技巧\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"8. 常见错误与调试技巧\"></a>8. 常见错误与调试技巧</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>易错点</strong>:<ul>\n<li>忽略首尾字符无法翻转的情况。</li>\n<li>错误地认为左右字符必须与 <code>T</code> 中对应位置的字符相同。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>调试方法</strong>:<ul>\n<li>通过打印中间变量 <code>s</code>, <code>ans</code>, <code>possible</code> 来跟踪程序执行过程。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>测试用例</strong>:<ul>\n<li>使用不同长度和内容的字符串进行测试，确保算法的正确性。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"9-总结与扩展\"><a href=\"#9-总结与扩展\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"9. 总结与扩展\"></a>9. 总结与扩展</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>核心收获</strong>:<ul>\n<li>学会使用贪心算法解决字符串翻转问题。</li>\n<li>理解翻转操作的条件和限制。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>举一反三</strong>:<ul>\n<li>类似题目如 “翻转二进制字符串”、”翻转字符串 II” 等。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>进阶方向</strong>:<ul>\n<li>进一步优化算法，考虑更复杂的情况，如多个可能的翻转序列等。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","categories":[],"tags":[{"name":"Python","path":"api/tags/Python.json"},{"name":"蓝桥杯","path":"api/tags/蓝桥杯.json"},{"name":"算法题解","path":"api/tags/算法题解.json"},{"name":"P13888","path":"api/tags/P13888.json"}]}